# Per-route image-request fragments.
# During the parallel build each page-builder writes its own route's
# `## IMG-<id>` block here (e.g. `home.md`, `services.md`) instead of appending
# to the shared IMAGE_REQUESTS.md. `npm run merge` composes the `## Requests`
# section of IMAGE_REQUESTS.md from these, sorted by ID. Slot IDs are
# pre-assigned in IMAGE_SLOTS.md / the Build Manifest, so rows never collide.
